{"body":{"assignments":[{"description":"Assignment/Homework Perform SEO audit of assigned website: - Analyze current content - Check meta tags and titles - Review URL structure Implement SEO improvements: - Add/optimize meta descriptions - Improve keyword placement - Create XML sitemap - Set up Google Search Console Document findings: - Current SEO status report - Improvements implemented - Optimization recommendations SEO audit report and optimized website with improved metadata"}],"big_question":"How can we optimize our websites to rank better in search engines and increase visibility?","class_name":"Year 1","end_time":"14:30","entry_id":9,"evaluation":{"prepared_by":"NIYONGABO Emmanuel","references":"","teacher_notes":"Evaluation of the session and Teacher's notes: ….…………………………………………………………………………… ….………………………………………………… ….…………………………… Did trainees understand SEO principles? ☐ Yes ☐ Partially ☐ No Can trainees identify optimization opportunities? ☐ Yes ☐ Partially ☐ No Can trainees use SEO tools? ☐ Yes ☐ Partially ☐ No Observations: ….……………………………………………………………………………","verified_by":"………………………………………"},"facilitation_techniques":"Demonstration","indicativeContent":[{"category":"General","content":"a. Optimize a web page for search engines"},{"category":"General","content":"b. Ways to optimize the website"},{"category":"General","content":"Sitemap creation and management"},{"category":"General","content":"Keyword research and placement"},{"category":"General","content":"Meta tags and descriptions"},{"category":"General","content":"c. HTML Elements for SEO"},{"category":"General","content":"Title tags"},{"category":"General","content":"Meta descriptions"},{"category":"General","content":"Header tags (H1, H2, H3)"},{"category":"General","content":"d. Webmaster tools"},{"category":"General","content":"Google Search Console"},{"category":"General","content":"Bing Webmaster Tools"},{"category":"General","content":"e. Page structure optimization"},{"category":"General","content":